WEBVTT

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.500
Friendship, huh?

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.500
I don't get it.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:08.840
What?

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.300
Not once in all my years

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:14.630
have I ever felt the emotion
called friendship towards any person.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.930
Being far too powerful

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.390
can be really painful.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:25.600
Impossible!

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:28.900
He consumes 330,000
Spiritual Power in one go,

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.320
and his own Furyoku is 1,25 million?

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.820
Are we to regenerate a third time?

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:37.200
No, we don't have enough Furyoku for that!

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.950
Dad! Can't you see me?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.080
So this is the dad
who Chocolove killed way back when, huh?

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:49.840
But being so attached to that thing
that he'd possess his own daughter…

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.630
is kind of freaky.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.090
Redseb.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:57.390
Your dad is what they call
an earthbound spirit.

00:00:57.470 --> 00:01:02.060
He died still obsessed with the Golem,
the thing that meant most to him,

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:04.310
and he's blind
to what's around him. That's all.

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:07.310
Trust your dad.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.270
Yoh…

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:11.400
It doesn't matter what you do.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:15.450
The responsibility
will come back to confront you.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:19.370
<i>In a lawful society,
you are punished by the law.</i>

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:24.040
<i>In a lawless society,
you are unprotected by the law.</i>

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:26.160
You get

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:28.420
what you give.

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.130
{}But what matters is your heart!

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:37.090
And we

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:39.640
have accepted that!

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:46.850
You have no intention

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:49.350
of just walking away, do you?

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:52.690
No. Everyone's here.

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:56.320
Spirit of Sword…

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.160
Inspired by Matamune's Demon Slayer, huh?

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.280
Right.

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:06.540
Looking at that Over Soul hurts my heart.

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:08.960
<i>Because he</i>

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:13.500
<i>might just have been
my one and only friend.</i>

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:17.470
Hao-sama?

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:21.510
The stars have come out!

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:26.350
Oh, yeah. I was in the middle of a walk…

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:33.510
Episode 37

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:33.510
Episode 37

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:33.510
Winds of Laughter

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:33.510
Winds of Laughter

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.190
He went home
because his heart was hurting?

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:37.490
I feel kind of deflated.

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:40.240
Thank goodness.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:43.830
Because you would probably
have been taken out first, as ever.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.450
Ren! What did you say to me, asshole?

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:50.960
He probably came to save us.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:52.040
What?

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.210
Right.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.340
Our real problem is what to do now.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:57.920
What do we do, Yoh?

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:01.010
I want to help Redseb and his family.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.430
So I want to stop the Golem somehow.

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:06.680
I'm not sure how,

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:10.640
so I guess you guys won't mind
if I leave the rest to you…

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:12.810
Yoh!

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:15.770
Stop, you say?

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:21.490
You kids? With your puny Furyoku?

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:24.240
Don't insult me like that!

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.240
<i><i>Camel Muntzer…</i></i>

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:31.620
<i><i>I met him on Mt. Kailash.</i></i>

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:33.960
<i><i>A lover of mountains.</i></i>

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:38.300
<i><i>If he saw a mountain, he wasn't happy
until he'd climbed to the top of it.</i></i>

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:42.880
<i><i>That summed up his personality
as a scientist very well.</i></i>

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.100
<i><i>We hit it off right away.</i></i>

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:49.810
<i><i>It didn't take long until
we'd call each other close friends.</i></i>

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:53.900
<i><i>I had no interest in his research.</i></i>

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:56.980
<i><i>But I admired his devotion.</i></i>

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:01.400
I'm sure you feel the same way, Mickey.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:02.950
What…

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:07.240
Whatever enemies it makes me,
I have no choice but to do what I do.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.160
Should the worst happen,

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.580
please take care of the Golem and my kids.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.750
Of course.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:19.670
<i><i>Please stop him any way you can,</i></i>

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.130
<i><i>Yoh.</i></i>

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:27.050
Where is everyone?

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:32.560
Do me the favor

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.480
of replenishing the Golem's Furyoku!

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.650
With your souls!

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.230
Die!

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.240
Lyserg!

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:46.360
We can't fight him!

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:50.160
Redseb's little sister
is inside the Golem!

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:52.120
So what should we do?

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.580
All we can do right now is run!

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.670
Want to hear

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.420
an old story about Yoh?

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:02.460
An old story?

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.380
About how the scar on his belly

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:07.510
was given to him by my Demon.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.510
And about Matamune.

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:13.770
Because he may well be

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:18.440
<i>the final key to defeating Hao.</i>

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.030
He's following from a safe distance.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.870
What a pain in the ass
to have to deal with this now.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.540
Sorry, guys.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.660
This is all because I took the Golem.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:39.440
Then show some responsibility.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:40.170
Ren!

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.300
If you want to help your sister,
then face him.

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:46.630
I don't think you have
enough time to waste crying.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:48.340
Ren…

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:52.720
I think the reason the Golem
isn't attacking us

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.720
is because you are here.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:56.770
Okay!

00:05:57.270 --> 00:05:59.690
If I can make Dad hear me,

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:02.190
maybe he'll stop the Golem!

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:04.320
He's totally fixated!

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:06.440
He can't even see you--

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:09.030
Don't talk bad about my dad!

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:11.320
Dad…

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:13.330
<i>Dad…</i>

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:17.000
I will stop him!

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.500
But…

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:20.330
Lyserg.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.420
Should it come to it, I'll act as a decoy.

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:27.670
While you take everyone away on Zelel.

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:28.880
Ren…

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:33.760
The little guy's trying
to show some nerve.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.600
I should help him out, shouldn't I?

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:43.060
They've stopped?

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.480
Strange. What on earth are they planning?

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:50.910
Some kind of strategy
to deplete the Golem's Furyoku?

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:53.280
Damn you!

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:55.370
You think we'll lie down and take that?

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:57.410
Dad! It's me!

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:58.870
Redseb!

00:06:58.960 --> 00:06:59.870
Please!

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:02.380
<i>Listen to me!</i>

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.920
The one who will become Shaman King…

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:08.800
is me!

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.510
Dad…

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.230
<i>Don't you worry about a thing.</i>

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:23.810
This is my fault.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:36.450
It was deflected?

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:38.910
<i>Not quite.</i>

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:41.620
I blew it away

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.830
with the Winds of Laughter!

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:47.960
I had no idea any of that
had happened to him.

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:51.420
I wonder why Yoh never told me.

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:55.140
Because you're Matamune's reincarnation.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:56.720
That is to say,

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:59.180
you're Mantamune!

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:00.520
Mantamune?

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:01.850
Just kidding.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.730
Yoh was just embarrassed, no doubt.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:07.650
You and Matamune are a similar height,

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:10.230
and, Mantamune, you know…

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:11.530
Well…

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.570
Even your names are kind of alike.

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:19.620
When Yoh first met you
and called you his friend,

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:25.000
it might have been because you
reminded him of Matamune a little.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:31.130
<i>When Anna's ability to read minds
turned her into a monster,</i>

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:33.170
<i>Yoh saved her…</i>

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:37.390
<i>And knowing that it would cause him
so much suffering for so long,</i>

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:41.810
<i>why did Yoh choose Anna, I wonder?</i>

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.270
Oh, no! You must have heard what I was…

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:49.400
I don't have that power anymore.

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:50.480
What?

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:52.030
I wonder why.

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:55.700
After Yoh vanquished
the Giant Demon and we said goodbye,

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:58.820
I lost the ability to do that
for some reason.

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:02.370
Maybe it went away with the Demon.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:05.330
Or maybe Yoh has some kind of other power.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:06.460
I don't know.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:10.130
But if it's Yoh that saved me,

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:14.380
I'll do everything I can to repay him.

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:20.350
Whatever happens,

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.640
I plan on making Yoh the Shaman King.

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:26.230
Hao-sama,

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:28.600
why did you leave the Golem?

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:32.530
Spirit of Fire would be very happy
if he ate the Golem.

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:35.400
That's right, Opacho.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:39.240
But you've already answered
your own question.

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:40.160
What?

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:45.410
I left the Golem to help Yoh.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.660
What?

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:49.040
You read my mind again, Hao-sama!

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:51.670
I don't like that power!

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:53.960
You're a good,
straightforward kid, Opacho.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:57.680
I hate it too.

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:02.310
I need Yoh to be stronger still.

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:04.680
So I thought

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.100
I'd make use of the Golem here.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:12.150
Matamune, the one I gave my Furyoku,
is no longer in this world.

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:15.360
But when I meet him again,

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:18.990
Yoh must also be there.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.410
So Opacho.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:25.790
I have a little job for you later.

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:28.040
Okay?

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:42.580
My name is Chocolove Mcdonell.

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:47.730
You probably don't even realize
that you're dead,

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.310
so let me tell you.

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.230
<i>Christmas, three years ago…</i>

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:56.320
I'm the one who killed you!

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:58.860
I'm…

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:00.950
dead?

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.200
Come here, Mic!

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.580
Let's fight together!

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:13.080
My intermediary is here, right?

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:15.540
Chocolove-dono!

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:16.880
Are you…

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:19.670
Me? Dead?

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:22.800
I've never heard
such utter nonsense in my life!

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.230
Amazing!

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:41.820
He weaved his Over Soul
like a spider's web

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:44.910
and is using it as a platform
to dash around, huh?

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:46.700
But how?

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:47.740
My guess

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.870
is that big face's Over Soul.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.830
That's an Olmec Stone Head!

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.500
My name is Orona.

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:01.010
I am Chocolove's teacher!

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:02.260
Teacher?

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:03.550
Ledger?

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.330
Teacher

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.330
Teacher

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.330
Ledger

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.330
Ledger

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:05.510
Lame.

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:13.520
Chocolove was afraid of the dark.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:16.520
<i>His parents were killed
when he was but an infant,</i>

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.820
<i>then he himself became a gang member</i>

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:21.150
<i>and repeated the same mistakes.</i>

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:26.620
<i>However you atone for your crimes,
they never go away.</i>

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:31.040
<i>Agonizing over
and grappling with your thoughts</i>

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:34.170
<i>only makes them weigh on you
all the more heavily.</i>

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:38.750
But he had a ray of hope.

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.090
<i>All of you!</i>

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.630
<i>Without having other people,</i>

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:45.470
<i>life isn't livable.</i>

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:49.350
To find the answer for himself,

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:52.640
he needed all of you above anything else.

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.940
Friends with the same powers.

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:57.980
Friends with the same past.

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:02.940
That's why he came all the way back here.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.650
To present his soul as it is,

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:07.450
and receive judgment!

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:12.200
Well done. You've made it here.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.960
After going through all those communes,

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.460
I feel like I appreciate
how small I am now.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:25.630
Now for your final trial.

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:29.760
The answer to the question of why
a Shaman's Furyoku grows with their death

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:31.970
is inside of you.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:33.390
Right!

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:36.440
I'll give it my best shot!

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:39.480
So I can give people answers!

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:47.150
<i>Very well! Now, would you like to see
what the 1,000-year-old soul</i>

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:50.240
<i>of Pascual Abaj is capable of?</i>

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:52.200
Pascual Abaj?

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:55.500
Someone who once entered the Shaman Fight

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.620
and gave us hope.

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:01.250
While he did not come away victorious,

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.800
the bravery he showed
led to his eventual deification,

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:08.260
and he became a god
prayed to by us, ancient people.

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:12.560
Can you handle what he will throw at you?

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:15.600
This is your final test!

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:18.730
Are you telling me to show bravery?

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:23.820
<i><i>People are held captive
by everyday, invisible fears</i></i>

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:25.860
<i><i>and restrain their actions.</i></i>

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:29.410
<i><i>And the greatest fear of all is death.</i></i>

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.700
<i><i>But I've died already.</i></i>

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.870
<i><i>I have nothing to be afraid of!</i></i>

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:38.710
No.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:42.040
<i><i>Living with no fear of death</i></i>

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:44.380
<i><i>is the same as giving up on life.</i></i>

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:47.920
<i><i>That isn't true courage.</i></i>

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.470
<i><i>That pain isn't something
that can be overcome</i></i>

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:52.720
<i><i>or will be overcome!</i></i>

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:56.680
Let me tell you something.

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:58.930
Losing all hope

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:01.980
and being trapped in that darkness

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:05.190
is far worse than death!

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:11.030
Yeah, I killed you.

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.620
But so what?

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.530
Your soul as a scientist,

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:17.580
as a Shaman,

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:19.500
hasn't died whatsoever!

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:21.750
Come on.

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:24.500
Let's put an end to this!

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:28.550
To my life and yours, at the Shaman Fight!

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:30.970
Interesting.

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:34.050
I guess I'll accept your challenge!

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:38.560
<i><i>This is for the best, right, Old Man?</i></i>

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:42.350
<i><i>There's nothing I can do
to erase my crimes.</i></i>

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:44.310
<i><i>All I can do now</i></i>

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:47.230
<i><i>is save his soul!</i></i>

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:50.150
<i><i>Even if it costs me my life.</i></i>

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:53.280
Over Soul!

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:55.740
Mic in Jaguars!

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:59.660
In Pascual Abaj!

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.800
Double Over Soul!

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:14.840
Jaguarman!

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:18.720
Explosive Beast Spin!

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:23.850
Jaguar Shaft!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:48.840
Watch closely how your father fights, son.

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:51.010
We Shamans

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:54.970
have long fought
to protect our people, our families,

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:58.930
and everyone's peace of mind.

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:03.560
I'm certain your father
also started out that way.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:07.690
Even when dead, our sentiments remain.

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:10.860
Watch closely how Shamans fight!

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:13.780
No pretense or unnecessary adornments,

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:17.030
just a clash of two raw,
undisguised souls!

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:19.320
Here we go!

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:21.370
Take this!

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:28.920
What the…

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:28.920
What the…

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.800
That serves you both right for fighting.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:34.880
Here she comes!

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:40.930
Are you going to sleep all day, Yoh?

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:43.890
Anna!

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:47.190
Right. Playtime is over.

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:49.350
I'm putting an end to this!

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:51.900
An end?

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:53.900
Too bad.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:58.160
That last attack used up
the last of the Golem's Furyoku.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:03.080
I will wipe the Golem
from the face of the earth myself.

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:07.370
Please take care of these children,

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:08.960
followers of Mickey.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:11.340
Dad!

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:13.130
Redseb…

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:16.670
I was no good as a father, was I?

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:20.140
It's utterly deplorable.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:23.760
I completely neglected you
as I worked on my research day and night.

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:25.520
Only for this…

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:32.150
What matters is the heart…

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:34.530
I'm so…

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:36.780
sorry.

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:41.820
Now,

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.490
it's about time I get going.

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.540
Wait.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.250
Who said I came here to stop the Golem?

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.420
What?

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:55.090
I mean, it would be a waste to destroy it
if it's so strong, wouldn't it?

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:57.550
I came to take the Golem

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:00.590
to beat Hao with!

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:07.390
That's not what you said!

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:11.810
Who foists their kids
on someone else then disappears?

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:13.650
It's damn selfish if you ask me!

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:16.480
But the Golem's Furyoku is…

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:19.650
Just give it some more
and it will be back on the move.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:25.240
This is why I need you to tell me
how to make it work.

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:27.240
You don't mind sticking
with us for a while,

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.330
do you?

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:36.250
<i>And so this little incident
came to a close.</i>

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:42.470
<i>Professor Muntzer understandably
couldn't hide his confusion,</i>

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:45.350
<i>but it was business as usual
for everyone else,</i>

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:48.100
<i>and so we had a big feast </i>

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:50.640
<i>and slept as usual.</i>

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:56.650
<i>Yoh and Chocolove
were taken away by Faust to be treated.</i>

00:19:58.150 --> 00:19:59.940
<i>Redseb and Seyram,</i>

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:03.030
<i>as if all the strain they were under
had suddenly been relieved,</i>

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:05.570
<i>slept in Anna's room,
along with a few others.</i>

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:11.790
<i>Having failed to get
either his son or future daughter-in-law,</i>

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.920
<i>Mikihisa slept out in the elements.</i>

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:19.880
<i>Ryu went to meet Gandhara again
in the hope of resurrecting Chocolove.</i>

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:25.510
<i>Faust discovered a new power
known as the </i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu.

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:27.850
<i>Lyserg…</i>

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.180
<i>Horohoro…</i>

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:32.810
<i>Ren…</i>

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:34.770
<i>Hao…</i>

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:37.610
<i>Anna…</i>

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:43.400
<i>A very long night of soul-searching
and pondering over their own riddles</i>

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:46.030
<i>came to an end for each of them.</i>

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:02.300
Hey! You finally woke up.

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:09.100
I'm sorry. It's my fault
you had to go through this too.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:10.930
I don't mind.

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:15.190
It seems like my Furyoku
has grown a little too.

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.860
Anyway, never mind that, Chocolove.

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:21.110
Your sight…

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:24.280
Is it true that when Gandhara revived you,

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:27.610
you asked for it to be that way?

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:33.040
Well, I had an idea.

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:35.000
You know what they say

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.920
if you lose one of your senses,

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.040
the others become much sharper?

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:43.460
I thought that maybe this
would boost my Furyoku a little.

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:46.840
That's not all, is it?

00:21:48.430 --> 00:21:50.010
What are you going to do?

00:21:50.760 --> 00:21:53.520
It's not about atonement.

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:58.270
I just wanted to make those two laugh.

00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:00.770
Redseb is one thing,

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:04.740
but Seyram closed her heart
all because of me.

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:09.570
I wondered what I should do,
but I came up with nothing.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:12.530
So in order to understand how she feels,

00:22:12.620 --> 00:22:15.370
I thought I'd try shutting the light out.

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:18.670
Pretty dumb, right?

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:20.380
Yes.

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:22.500
It's not funny at all!

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:23.630
Hey!

